    <unit id="=&gt;q56" name="=&gt;q56">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">112</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He takes a look at his scar, staring at it for a few moments, taking a sip of his drink in the process.::

The scar is from an accident. The tattoo is from a tattoo shop.&lt;end&gt;</source>
