    <unit id="=&gt;q73" name="=&gt;q73">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">146</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Gorge goes for the glass, but freezes after a second. He remains like that for a few moments, then faces you again.::

He was wrong, aight. It... wasn't my brother. It was my son.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
