    <unit id="=&gt;q79" name="=&gt;q79">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">158</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Go bug someone else about it, aight? The reason I come to places like this is so that I don't have to think about my freakin' job, and now you're reminding me of it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
